usage: control.py [-h] [--samples SAMPLES] [--interval INTERVAL] [--edge]
                  [--view {color,gray,edge}] [--set R G B GAMMA PHASE]

Control the independent 720p60 area-filtered camera build.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --samples SAMPLES
  --interval INTERVAL
  --edge                Use the edge-system project
  --view {color,gray,edge}
                        Edge display mode; keeps active gains
  --set R G B GAMMA PHASE
                        Q8.8 gains (256=1x), gamma 0/1, Bayer phase 0..3
